.TH INFOCOM 6.SH NAMEinfocom, infocom.tcap \- play Z-machine adventures.SH SYNOPSIS\fBinfocom.tcap\fRstory.z3.SH DESCRIPTIONAn interpreter for Infocom's Z-machine, version 3: the virtual machineInfocom's text adventures ran on, and that Inform writes today.  Give it astory file and play by typing commands in English.\fB/dd/GAMES/INFORM\fRhas three to try -- dejavu, hellow and shell, demonstrations for Inform..PP\fBinfocom.tcap\fRis the build for a terminal, and the one to use: it keeps a status linewith the room and the score at the top of the screen.  Plain\fBinfocom\fRwrites that line's cursor codes as literal text down the left margin..SH SEE ALSOinform, advent